<title>NEW ZEALAND: UGF to respond to takeover bid by Jan 30.</title>
<headline>UGF to respond to takeover bid by Jan 30.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Underground Fashions on Monday said it would consider an offer by Kimbyr Investments Ltd for all the shares in the company at 33.5 NZ cents per share and make a recommendation to shareholders by January 30.</p>
<p>Kimbyr Investments Ltd is wholly owned by Just Jeans Holdings Limited.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
